---
// Tier 1 wood cards. The channel label is what per-channel scan counts group
// by, so it stays stable even if this file is renamed.
//
// This is a card someone is holding, so it is an AR channel: add `ar` here
// once the module exists. It is off today because the module does not.
//
// Path decided 08-28-26 (AR card prompt pack v4): /greetings = tier 1 wood.
// The URL is wired now because wiring costs nothing; the one-way door is
// etching it into physical wood, which has not happened yet. See
// docs/ar-card/HANDOFF.md and docs/lab-backlog.md ("AR card" > decision
// gates) before ordering a run of etched cards.
import CardLanding from '../components/CardLanding.astro';
---

<CardLanding channel="wood" path="/greetings/" />
